		{
			"type": "yaml",
			"value": "title: generateBuildId\ndescription: Configure the build id, which is used to identify the current build in which your application is being served."
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Next.js generates an ID during "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "next build"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " to identify which version of your application is being served. The same build should be used and boot up multiple containers."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "If you are rebuilding for each stage of your environment, you will need to generate a consistent build ID to use between containers. Use the "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "generateBuildId"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " command in "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "next.config.js"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": ":"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "code",
			"lang": "jsx",
			"meta": "filename=\"next.config.js\"",
			"value": "module.exports = {\n\tgenerateBuildId: async () => {\n\t\t// This could be anything, using the latest git hash\n\t\treturn process.env.GIT_HASH\n\t},\n}"
		},
		{
			"type": "blockquote",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "paragraph",
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "strong",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "Good to know:"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": " When "
						},
						{
							"type": "link",
							"title": null,
							"url": "/docs/app/api-reference/config/next-config-js/deploymentId",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "inlineCode",
									"value": "deploymentId"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": " is set, Next.js uses a constant build ID unless you explicitly configure "
						},
						{
							"type": "inlineCode",
							"value": "generateBuildId"
						},
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": ". "
						},
						{
							"type": "link",
							"title": null,
							"url": "/docs/app/guides/self-hosting#version-skew",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "Version skew"
